@booking = http://localhost:7001
@gateway = http://localhost:7002

### 1. Hold a seat
# @name hold
POST {{booking}}/shows/SHOW-2/holds
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice

{ "seats": ["D7"] }

### 2. Check out: booking PENDING_PAYMENT with a gateway session and payUrl (repeat-safe)
# @name checkout
POST {{booking}}/holds/{{hold.response.body.id}}/checkout
X-User: alice

### 3a. Pay in a browser: {{checkout.response.body.payUrl}}
### 3b. ...or press Pay without the page (decline: "outcome": "decline")
POST {{gateway}}/sessions/{{checkout.response.body.sessionId}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{ "outcome": "approve" }

### 4. The booking with its timeline (CONFIRMED once the webhook arrived)
GET {{booking}}/bookings/{{checkout.response.body.id}}

### What the web app calls on return from the gateway: asks the gateway, applies the result once
POST {{booking}}/bookings/{{checkout.response.body.id}}/verify

### My bookings
GET {{booking}}/bookings
X-User: alice

### A forged webhook: 401 INVALID_SIGNATURE
POST {{booking}}/webhooks/gateway
Content-Type: application/json
Gateway-Signature: t=1700000000,v1=00

{ "id": "evt_fake", "type": "payment.succeeded", "createdAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "data": { "sessionId": "ps_x", "merchantRef": "x", "amountCents": 1, "status": "PAID" } }

### Lab: the payment session ends this long before the hold
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMarginMs": 10000 }
